    -type f is used fro specifying the file type as normal file
    -size 1033c It is used to specify the size of the file i.e. 1033 bytes in this case 
    ! -executable This is used to specify that the file is not executable 
5.after executing the find command it gave a file location as follows:_
    ./maybehere/.file2
